        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9141/30, Lorabelle Solid Brass Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Lorabelle Cabinet Knob emulates the classic elegance of days gone by. Few designs rival this knob's quiet nod to Victorian design while still maintaining the modern quality that can only be expected of solid brass cabinet pulls. The Lorabelle Solid Brass Cabinet Knob is available in a wide array of classic finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/lorabelle-vintage-finish-cabinet-knob-omnia-9141-30\"><b>Omnia Lorabelle Vintage Finish Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Lorabelle Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/made-usa-logo.jpg?v=1704354497\" width=\"515\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
